  "details": "The htmLawed module enables use of the [htmLawed](https://bioinformatics.org/phplabware/internal_utilities/htmLawed/index.php) PHP library as a filter in a Text Format for restriction/filtering of HTML in textual input.\n\nThe module's filtering of malicious HTML can be bypassed by using a malformed UTF8 character, leading to a cross-site scripting (XSS) vulnerability.\n\nOnly sites using an SQLite database are affected with versions of the htmLawed library prior to 1.2.17.",
